# Second guard for the Dockerfile's explicit COPY lines: send only what the image needs.
# Ignore everything...
*

# ...then allow the app package, its requirements and the prompts
!backend
backend/*
!backend/app
!backend/requirements.txt
!prompts

# ...and never these, even inside the allowed folders (later lines win)
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.env*
**/*.pdf
